# Immutable WAL SST fixtures generated by historical SlateDB code.
# V1: commit ecb57a3 (before V2 became the default).
# V2: commit 35a8059 (the V2 default introduction).
# Each fixture contains values, a merge operand, a tombstone, timestamps,
# expiry, duplicate keys, and multiple blocks.
v1-none 
v1-snappy 
v1-zlib 
v1-lz4 
v1-zstd 
v1-xor 
v2-none 
v2-snappy 
v2-zlib 
v2-lz4 
v2-zstd 
v2-xor 
